@startuml
title Smart sladding - overall architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

cloud "External systems" {
  [Database\ndocument queue + sladd labels] as db
  [Document API\nserves the PDFs] as dok
}

[Batch job\nwalks the unprocessed\ndocuments] as jobb

[Model API\nfinds fødselsnummer in a PDF\n(OCR + YOLO)] as modell

package "Development and improvement" {
  [Analysis and test tools\nmeasure accuracy against fasit,\nvisualise the results] as verktoy
  [Training pipeline\ntrains the YOLO model] as trening
}

jobb --> db : 1. fetch unprocessed\n4. store sladdinger
jobb --> dok : 2. fetch PDF
jobb --> modell : 3. PDF in -> sladd boxes out

verktoy ..> modell : runs the same model code\nlocally on test documents
trening ..> modell : delivers new weights (best.pt)
db ..> trening : labels used\nas training data
@enduml
